@*
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Admin page template — copy this file to create a new routable admin page.
  This route is intentionally omitted from NavMenu. Open directly, e.g.:
  https://localhost:5001/admin/dev/page-template
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Checklist when copying:
  - Rename file and set a unique @page route (e.g. @page "/admin/your-feature").
  - Adjust [Authorize(Roles = "Admin")] if a different policy is required.
  - Replace placeholder content; wire DbContext, services, and modals as needed.
  - For list + edit/delete UIs, use jQuery DataTables: API in
    AdminCatalogGridController (or a dedicated controller), empty
    &lt;table&gt; with id + classes &quot;hd-dt cell-border compact stripe&quot;.
    In OnAfterRenderAsync, do not gate on firstRender only — if the grid is inside
    @if (data ready), call helpdeskAdmin.needsInit then register (once) + init*
    so the table initializes after async lookups render. JSInvokable handlers
    for row actions; IAsyncDisposable to destroyTable + unregister.
    See .cursor/rules/helpdesk-jquery-datatables-grids.mdc.
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*@

@page "/admin/dev/page-template"

@attribute [Authorize(Roles = "Admin")]

<PageTitle>Page template</PageTitle>

<div class="hd-admin-page">
    <h1>New admin page</h1>
    <p class="muted">This template is not linked from the sidebar. Duplicate the file and change the <code>@@page</code> route to use it.</p>
</div>

